OL,3,CFormer footballer Jamie Carragher will
OL,4,Cnot be made bankrupt
OL,6,FNo figure for the debt has been given
OL,7,Fin court.
OL,9,FCarragher, who was born in Bootle on
OL,10,FMerseyside, spent his entire
OL,11,Fprofessional playing career with
OL,12,FLiverpool, including being part of the
OL,13,Fsquad which won the Champions League
OL,14,Fin 2005.
OL,16,FSince retiring as a player, he has
OL,17,Fcarved out a successful media career
OL,18,Fas a pundit, working for the likes of
OL,19,FSky Sports and CBS Sports.
